  "detectors": {
    "credit_card": {
      "notes": [
        "Macie: a 13-19 digit sequence that passes the Luhn check and uses a standard card number prefix for American Express, Dankort, Diners Club, Discover, Electron, JCB, Mastercard, UnionPay or Visa. Macie does not publish its prefix table; this one is ours.",
        "Ours, not Macie's: groups separated by spaces or hyphens are also accepted (4-4-4-4, 4-4-4-4-3, Amex 4-6-5, Diners 4-6-4), with one separator throughout (David, 2026-11-01). Macie's docs only say digit sequence."
      ],
      "min_length": 13,
      "max_length": 19,
